### Get all products
GET http://localhost:5000/api/products?minPrice=600&&maxPrice=1000

### Get single product
GET http://localhost:5000/api/products/8


### Create new product
POST http://localhost:5000/api/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6MSwidXNlclR5cGUiOiJhZG1pbiIsImlhdCI6MTc5MjkzODAyNywiZXhwIjoxNzkzMDI0NDI3fQ.CwCU2BcvXO6wMpf-9o6a5V7qeub-0FvXa5rwI3BSbtA

{
  "title": "phone",
  "description": "about book6 ",
  "price": 1000
}

### Update product
